[1.28, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.43, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.431, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 1. The operator and the webhook are both installed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.14, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  webapp-operator and provenance-gate are both running\r\n"]
[2.142, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.143, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 2. The subjects exist in the registry\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.562, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  service image ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate@sha256:dab072be...d0f866fd\r\n"]
[3.563, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  decoy image   ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate-decoy@sha256:8da452da...820516ad\r\n"]
[3.564, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.567, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 3. The namespace and the trust root the IDP would create\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.111, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  BuildIdentity .../demo-service is Ready, governing the WebApp and its pods\r\n"]
[4.112, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.113, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 4. CASE 2: a WebApp running an image off Docker Hub is REJECTED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.242, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  rejected: nc/nginx-unprivileged\", which BuildIdentity .../demo-service does not cover (allowed:\u2026\r\n"]
[4.243, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.245, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 5. CASE 3: a WebApp running a genuinely signed image from another workflow is REJECTED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.374, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  rejected: 9fa1039e102428b22bb3768ca55ad820516ad satisfies this workload's build identity: image\u2026\r\n"]
[4.375, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.375, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 6. CASE 1: the WebApp running its own service's image is ADMITTED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.503, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  WebApp idp-apps/demo-service admitted\r\n"]
[4.503, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.504, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 7. The operator reconciles it, and the pods it creates are admitted too\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.884, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  1 pod(s) created and admitted from the WebApp\r\n"]
[4.884, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.885, "o", "\u001b[32m F4 VERIFIER PASSED \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.886, "o", "  admitted  WebApp demo-service running ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate\r\n"]
[4.887, "o", "  rejected  the same WebApp on Docker Hub\r\n"]
[4.888, "o", "  rejected  the same WebApp on an image from another workflow\r\n"]
[4.89, "o", "\r\n"]
